		{
			"_id": "hIO2oU3iLfjia0Qe",
			"img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp",
			"name": "Thunder Drums",
			"sort": 700000,
			"system": {
				"actionType": {
					"value": "action"
				},
				"actions": {
					"value": 2
				},
				"category": "offensive",
				"description": {
					"value": "<p>The peal of a kaminari's drums bring thunder and lightning. The kaminari summons four 100-foot-tall columns of lightning to strike in @Template[burst|distance:5]s within 60 feet. These columns can't overlap. Creatures in the burst take @Damage[10d12[electricity]|options:area-damage] damage and must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:40|options:area-effect,damaging-effect,inflicts:stunned] save. The kaminari can't use Thunder Drums again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Thunder Drums]]{1d4 rounds}.</p><hr><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes half damage.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes double damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 2}.</p>",
					"gm": ""
				},
